From: IlyasRidhuan <ilyasridhuan@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 1 Sep 2026 13:16:48 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] test: tx effects tree coverage and regenerated PXE compat
 snapshots

TS coverage for the tx effects tree: leaf/root computation, membership
witness resolution and tampering, node interface schemas, and archiver
block store round-trips. PXE backwards-compatibility snapshots and the
compat network pins are regenerated for the new header field.

